WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:14.004
Choose "+ Object" and place a wall light and a switch on the wall.

2
00:00:14.504 --> 00:00:20.209
Or tap "Spread over the room": the spots are placed on a grid.

3
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:29.933
Choose a light level: you see the average in lux and how many more lamps are needed (guide).

4
00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:39.750
Give a lamp or switch a group (A to D) and a height.

5
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:46.577
Wall lights and switches appear at their height in the wall elevation.

6
00:00:47.077 --> 00:01:00.216
In the 3D view, all lamps are at their height.

7
00:01:00.716 --> 00:01:13.464
The PDF has a separate page with the lighting plan for each room.

